diff --git a/changelog.d/0.75.1/1478.fixed.md b/changelog.d/0.75.1/1478.fixed.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ba15122
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/0.75.1/1478.fixed.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+- ``soup ship --adapter`` now refuses an adapter whose ``lora_B`` tensors are all
+  zero (an untrained adapter, or TRL's DPO ``ref/`` sub-adapter) with the distinct
+  failed rule ``adapter_noop``, before any model is loaded. Such an adapter is
+  mathematically the base model; it used to be rejected only indirectly as "task
+  did not improve", which misreported the cause and was unreliable under noisy
+  sampling. Adapters with no ``lora_B`` keys (VeRA and other PEFT types) are not
+  checked.
